  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vital Support for Hawksbills in the Eastern Pacific Ocean: Year VI of Conservation at Top-Tier Nesting Beaches</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) community based patrols to deter illegal poaching of nesting females and eggs and counting of nests to monitor population trends at Los Cobanos and Punta Amapala, El Salvador and Machalilla and El Pelado in Ecuador, and 2) relocation of nests threatened by poaching or tidal inundation to safe beach hatcheries.</narrative>
  </description>
